    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried some of that baking soda and vinegar stuff but it didn't really do anything. and honestly, the timing of it is what's so weird. it's so random. like, i'll be washing dishes and it's totally fine, then i'll walk away for ten minutes and come back and it's suddenly full of water and making those little popping sounds again. it's almost like it's waiting for me to turn my back or something. is it possible there's something actually moving around in there that's causing the blockage to shift back and forth?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
